    "enUS": {
      "description": "The Orgrimmar Legion has put in a request for additional weapons that we haven't been able to provide at the moment.  Obtain the weapons they've requested and bring them to Merok Longstride outside of Hive'Regal.",
      "dialogue": {
        "37066849d3197d666c75": "You have something for me, $N?",
        "49395f3e286e341b4185": "Excellent work. We were in short supply of these, $N."
      },
      "summary": "Bring 3 Massive Iron Axes to Merok Longstride at the Orgrimmar Legion camp outside of Hive'Regal. You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VI in order to complete this quest.",
      "title": "Arms for the Field",
